--- !u!1001 &1607481653
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 79105025}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 3063783754419850682, guid: 9bef357fcd70a78488bfc5eddc5459a0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: SickFairy
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4731355039012173017, guid: 9bef357fcd70a78488bfc5eddc5459a0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'noGuide.Array.data[0]'
      value: I can feel the trail, but it's tangled... Follow it deeper. Every part of the forest has a heart stump that can heal it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4731355039012173017, guid: 9bef357fcd70a78488bfc5eddc5459a0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'aboutSister.Array.data[1]'
      value: The grove is the only place the sickness has not reached. It's at the very end of the trail, past the fog of the Mire. Look for the fireflies.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4731355039012173017, guid: 9bef357fcd70a78488bfc5eddc5459a0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'firstMeeting.Array.data[1]'
      value: I tried to fly for help. But the sickness is in the air here... my wings won't hold me. I keep falling.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4731355039012173017, guid: 9bef357fcd70a78488bfc5eddc5459a0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'firstMeeting.Array.data[2]'
      value: The whole forest is sick, part by part. My sister keeps the grove at the far end of the trail, and she cannot hold it alone.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4731355039012173017, guid: 9bef357fcd70a78488bfc5eddc5459a0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'firstMeeting.Array.data[3]'
      value: Every part of the forest has an old heart stump. Feed the stump what it asks for and that part will heal. Will you help us?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5459024329831810908, guid: 9bef357fcd70a78488bfc5eddc5459a0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalPosition.x
      value: 101
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5459024329831810908, guid: 9bef357fcd70a78488bfc5eddc5459a0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalPosition.y
      value: 7
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5459024329831810908, guid: 9bef357fcd70a78488bfc5eddc5459a0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalPosition.z
